#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "This module allows you to configure the settings for the trash."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete files older than"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to allow automatic deletion of files that are older than the "
"value specified. Leave this disabled to <emphasis>not</emphasis> "
"automatically delete any items after a certain timespan. Set the number of "
"days "
"that files can remain in the trash. Any files older than this will be "
"automatically deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Limit to maximum size"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to limit the trash to the maximum amount of disk space that "
"you "
"specify below. Otherwise, it will be unlimited."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:47
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum size"
msgstr "Tamaño &máximo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the maximum percent of disk space that will be used for the trash. "
"The "
"calculated amount of disk space that will be allowed for the trash is "
"displayed "
"right of the spinbox."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "When limit reached"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the size limit is reached, the selected action will be performed, either "
"the oldest or biggest files will be deleted automatically or you will be "
"warned."
msgstr ""


